ure. Your experience is real and worth taking seriously as a data point, but it's a very noisy one. Given how noisy it is, and given that we have a well-documented mechanism (stereotype threat, differential encouragement) that explains the pattern without invoking innate inferiority, I'd trust that explanation more than a leap to "girls just aren't as good at this."
